<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh March trade deficit widens to $280 mln.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh March trade deficit widens to $280 mln.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's trade deficit widened to $280 million in March from $247 million in February compared with $379.7 million in March, 1996, central bank officials said on Monday.</p>
<p>BANGLADESH'S BALANCE OF TRADE</p>
<p>(In millions of U.S. dollar)</p>
<p>			  March     February   March 96</p>
<p>    Exports	   386.0     356.0	201.6</p>
<p>    Imports	   666.O     603.0	581.3</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom +880-2-506363</p>
